<title>CHINA: China area under cotton falls 12.2 percent.</title>
<headline>China area under cotton falls 12.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The area of land cultivated land under cotton slumped in 1996 by 12.2 percent according to State Statistical Bureau figures available at the end of August, the Financial News said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The area of land under cotton fell by 660,000 hectares from 1995.</p>
<p>Official media has said China's cotton crop could fall to 3.8 million tonnes in 1996 from 4.5 million tonnes last year.</p>
</text>
